      lead: 'Instrument transformers convert currents and voltages proportionally and in phase into measurable, standardised values. They supply meters, measuring instruments and protection relays and insulate them from high voltage.',
      intro: 'RITZ supplies standard types and realises special requirements – from design to customer specification through to routine testing in the factory.',
